**What the indexed code shows**

- **Non-static data members** are lowerCamelCase with a trailing `_m`, and pointers get no special prefix:
  - `src/AbsBeamline/Solenoid.h` (commit `32e84702`, private "Variables" block near the end of the class; the MCP returned the whole file, so I have no exact line numbers): `std::string filename_m;`, `Fieldmap* fieldmap_m;`, `double scale_m;`, `bool fast_m;`.
