- OPALX `src/PartBunch/ParticleContainer.hpp:753-799` (commit f9d7679)
- IPPL `src/Particle/ParticleBase.hpp:91-123` (commit a8bd37e)
- IPPL `src/Particle/ParticleAttrib.hpp:25-37` (commit a8bd37e)

